/*!
 * \brief Traits for the streams of the C++ standard library
 *
 * This is the key point regarding interoperability between streams of the
 * <a href="https://cppreference.net/cpp/io.html" >standard C++ input/output library</a>
 * and Base64-based octet reading and writing.
 *
 * \note
 * In fact, this is where the motivation to provide support for Base-64 comes from, although keeping
 * the dependency as optional.
 *
 * These streams are character-based. This makes it possible to perform read and write operations on
 * octets embedded within them.
 *
 * \addtogroup in-out-base64-stdlib
 */

